LuCI: confirm checked IPv4 address changes at the new address.

Keep the rollback timer active until the new address accepts the one-time
confirmation token. Preserve protocol, port and page when reconnecting.
Recover pending confirmation after a fresh login, keep server and browser at
120 seconds. Authenticated recovery uses POST, CSRF and the original owner.
The feeds patch loop applies this to the pinned LuCI source for every theme.

